# Massacre Girl, Known Killer: "if its toughness was less than 1" includes exactly 0 (the boundary between the sibling
# scenarios' toughness -2, which draws, and toughness 1, which does not). Bot1's Memnite (1/1) has wither from Girl and
# attacks; Bot2's Elvish Mystic (1/1) blocks, receives one -1/-1 counter (CR 702.80a), is a 0/0 and dies (CR 704.5f)
# with toughness 0, so Bot1 draws one card. Memnite takes ordinary damage (the Mystic has no wither) and dies, which
# draws nothing since it is not an opponent's creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Massacre Girl, Known Killer
Memnite
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Elvish Mystic
Forest x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Massacre Girl, Known Killer.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Elvish Mystic > Memnite)
[T3 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Elvish Mystic
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Black Lotus
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
